lse},"created_at":"2025-06-24T10:57:41Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T10:57:41Z","body":"If you're a pro model user due to student account, you've probably lost access because of the request limit imposed, however, in my case, I'm a pro+ user with requests still available and I only started getting this problem after the update that imposed the request limits.\n\n4.1 is the only one that doesn't have a limit, I don't know if it's only available to you because you're a student account or if you've exceeded an assigned limit.\n\nFor now I'm working with versions from 1 month ago because I'm paying for a resource that used to consume requests but gave an error and didn't finish the service...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2999832444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3018211065","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875#issuecomment-3018211065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875","id":3018211065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6z5j75","user":{"login":"sijojlouis","id":7536253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzYyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7536253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis","html_url":"https://github.com/sijojlouis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sijojlouis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-30T08:12:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T08:12:08Z","body":"Additional (if it helps):\nI use macOS 12.7.6, i was constantly getting this error until I removed and re-installed fresh which worked for sometime until I started installing back the earlier plugins. So, currently I'm having to use it with only the following installed with the freshly installed VS Code..\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f31070e7-bae7-4094-ab5d-11f66e65abe5)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3018211065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3058654972","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875#issuecomment-3058654972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875","id":3058654972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc62T178","user":{"login":"deepak1556","id":964386,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NDM4Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/964386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556","html_url":"https://github.com/deepak1556","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepak1556/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-07-10T19:11:20Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T19:11:20Z","body":"Sorry for the delay in responding here, for users still affected please follow the steps below to capture a cpu profile with gc stats\n\n1) Close all running instances of the application\n2) Start the application with the following flags `code --trace --trace-category-filter=\"renderer,blink,gpu,v8,disabled-by-default-v8.cpu_profiler,disabled-by-default-v8.gc,disabled-by-default-v8.gc_stats\"`\n3) Once the crash happens\n4) Open command palette and run `Developer: Stop Tracing`\n\nThis will generate a trace file that you can attach to this issue\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3058654972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3393379256","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875#issuecomment-3393379256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875","id":3393379256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7KQtu4","user":{"login":"SPWizard01","id":27969609,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3OTY5NjA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27969609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01","html_url":"https://github.com/SPWizard01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SPWizard01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T14:25:07Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T14:25:07Z","body":"I was able to fix it by opening /etc/profile on alpine distro and adding `export NODE_OPTIONS=\"--max-old-space-size=4096\"`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3393379256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3448724992","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875#issuecomment-3448724992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12875","id":3448724992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7Nj14A","user":{"login":"dagmfre","id":96683816,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcNHKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96683816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagmfre","html_url":"https://github.com/dagmfre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagmfre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagmfre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagmfre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagmfre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip